@startuml
title Idempotent consumer: a message delivered twice has its effect once

participant "Subscriber" as S
participant "Use case" as U
database "Service database" as DB
queue "Pub/Sub" as PS

PS ->> S : message (id = m1)
S -> U : handle(m1)
U -> DB : insert m1 into the inbox
U -> DB : save the aggregate, insert outgoing messages
U --> S : done
S ->> PS : acknowledge

PS ->> S : message (id = m1) again
S -> U : handle(m1)
U -> DB : insert m1 into the inbox
DB --> U : already there
U --> S : already handled
S ->> PS : acknowledge
note over U, DB : nothing else was read,\nchanged or published
@enduml
